1
00:00:00,898 --> 00:00:02,148
(Sheldon:)September 22nd.

2
00:00:02,316 --> 00:00:04,656
(Sheldon:)Right,
the weekend after Leonard's dog died.

3
00:00:04,819 --> 00:00:06,989
(Leonard:)Mitzy's dead?

4
00:00:08,406 --> 00:00:13,076
(Sheldon:)She was old and blind, Leonard.
What choice did we have?

5
00:00:13,244 --> 00:00:15,834
(Leonard:)I don't believe this.
Why am I the last to know?

6
00:00:15,997 --> 00:00:18,127
(Sheldon:)Excuse me,
I am the one getting a divorce...

7
00:00:18,291 --> 00:00:21,671
(Beverley:)...Mitzy is the one who is dead,
why are you the one making a fuss?

8
00:00:22,503 --> 00:00:23,963
You're right. I'm sorry.

9
00:00:24,130 --> 00:00:26,970
(Leonard:)I'm way out of line.

10
00:00:29,677 --> 00:00:31,257
(Beverley:)Penny, what's new in your life?

11
00:00:31,846 --> 00:00:34,016
(Penny:)Nothing. Not a damn thing.

12
00:00:41,230 --> 00:00:43,360
(Beverley:)Thank you for driving me
back to my hotel.

13
00:00:43,524 --> 00:00:44,904
(Penny:)Oh, it's not a problem.

14
00:00:45,067 --> 00:00:48,947
(Beverley:)I was going to ask Leonard to do it, but
he seemed a bit emotionally unstable...

15
00:00:49,113 --> 00:00:52,653
(Beverley:)...and you don't want someone like that
operating heavy machinery.

16
00:00:52,825 --> 00:00:54,575
(Penny:)No, you do not.

17
00:00:54,744 --> 00:00:57,034
Your "check engine" light is on.

18
00:00:58,372 --> 00:01:03,022
(Penny:)Yeah, I gotta put a sticker over that.

